---
/**
 * About Why Section
 * "Our why": two paragraphs and four figures, in columns 7–12 at xl, full width below.
 * Figma: About / breakpoint=xl (frame 5044:17639), "our why"
 */
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";

interface Props {
  class?: string;
}

const { class: className } = Astro.props;

const figures = [
  { label: "Partnerships", value: "25+" },
  { label: "Our team", value: "4" },
  { label: "Years building", value: "7+" },
  { label: "Awards", value: "11" },
];
---

<section aria-labelledby="our-why" class={cn("px-container pb-section", className)}>
  <h2
    id="our-why"
    class="border-t border-border-subtle py-6 text-eyebrow text-fg-primary uppercase"
  >
    Our why
  </h2>
  <div class="grid-cols-layout pt-12">
    <div class="col-span-full flex flex-col gap-12 text-fg-primary xl:col-span-6 xl:col-start-7">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 text-body-md md:flex-row *:flex-1">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
          <p>
            Every company has a few moments that decide how it's seen: the day it comes out of
            stealth, the round it raises, the product it launches. Too often those moments arrive
            with a brand that doesn't fit, a site that lists features but doesn't make a case, and a
            product that shows off its complexity instead of resolving it. We started Studio Coal to
            help founders meet those moments properly.
          </p>
          <p>
            We kept it small on purpose. Small means the senior people stay on the work, decisions
            are quick, and nothing gets lost in a handoff. When a project needs more, we bring in
            specialists we've worked with for years.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
          <p>
            We're curious by nature. We try new tools early and use them to explore more than a
            small team otherwise could. But the more options there are, the more the work comes down
            to judgment: knowing what's right for this company at this moment, and making it with
            care.
          </p>
          <p>We'd rather do fewer things properly. That's the Studio Coal.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="grid animate-enter-stagger grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:grid-cols-4">
        {figures.map((figure) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-sm bg-bg-secondary p-4">
            <dt class="text-body-sm">{figure.label}</dt>
            <dd class="text-headline-xxl text-fg-tertiary">{figure.value}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
